{{!
    @template tool_vae/deposit_page

    The page of the deposits of a dossier, below its heading: one deposit as it was fixed (its note, its digest, the sentence
    of the labelling or the engagement, its sections, the fields left out, the opinions and the form of an opinion), or the
    list of the deposits (the sentence of the labelling, the form of a deposit, the table or "none"); then the way back.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\deposit_page. The template holds no logic: the states
    exclude one another before. The texts are escaped (double braces). Seven keys are HTML (triple braces): recordhtml and
    headinghtml, headings of the core ($output->heading(), text escaped by tool_vae\output\deposit_page); texthtml, a text
    deposited or an opinion (format_text() of the core, plain text); omittedhtml, a notification of the core
    ($output->notification()); formhtml and opinionformhtml, forms of the core (moodleform::render()), drawn once; tablehtml,
    the table drawn by the template tool_vae/table.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * note - false, or an object {label}: the note of the deposit
    * digest - false, or an object {text}: the digest of the deposit
    * labelling - false, or an object {text}: the sentence of the labelling of the validation dossier
    * engagement - false, or an object {text}: the engagement was confirmed
    * intro - false, or an object {text}: the sentence above the form of a deposit
    * formhtml - false, or HTML: the form of a deposit
    * sections - array of objects {recordhtml, headinghtml, version, texthtml}: recordhtml is false or HTML
    * omittedhtml - false, or HTML: the fields of the identity are left out
    * opinions - false, or an object {headinghtml, none, items, intro, opinionformhtml}: none and intro are false or an
      object {text}; items is an array of objects {by, texthtml}; opinionformhtml is false or HTML
    * none - false, or an object {text}: no deposit yet
    * tablehtml - false, or HTML: the table of the deposits
    * back - an object {url, label}: the way back

    Example context (json):
    {
        "note": {"label": "Second deposit."},
        "digest": {"text": "Digest: 3f2a9c41b07e"},
        "labelling": false,
        "engagement": {"text": "The engagement was confirmed."},
        "intro": false,
        "formhtml": false,
        "sections": [{"recordhtml": false, "headinghtml": "<h3>Identity</h3>", "version": "Version 2",
            "texthtml": "<div class=\"text_to_html\">My text.</div>"}],
        "omittedhtml": false,
        "opinions": {"headinghtml": "<h3>Opinions</h3>", "none": {"text": "No opinion yet."}, "items": [], "intro": false,
            "opinionformhtml": false},
        "none": false,
        "tablehtml": false,
        "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/deposit.php?userid=7", "label": "Back to the deposits"}
    }
}}
{{#note}}
<p>{{label}}</p>
{{/note}}
{{#digest}}
<p>{{text}}</p>
{{/digest}}
{{#labelling}}
<div class="alert alert-info tool-vae-labelling" role="note">{{text}}</div>
{{/labelling}}
{{#engagement}}
<p>{{text}}</p>
{{/engagement}}
{{#intro}}
<p>{{text}}</p>
{{/intro}}
{{#formhtml}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{/formhtml}}
{{#sections}}
{{#recordhtml}}
{{{recordhtml}}}
{{/recordhtml}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
<p class="text-muted small">{{version}}</p>
{{{texthtml}}}
{{/sections}}
{{#omittedhtml}}
{{{omittedhtml}}}
{{/omittedhtml}}
{{#opinions}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{#none}}
<p>{{text}}</p>
{{/none}}
{{#items}}
<p class="text-muted small">{{by}}</p>
{{{texthtml}}}
{{/items}}
{{#intro}}
<p>{{text}}</p>
{{/intro}}
{{#opinionformhtml}}
{{{opinionformhtml}}}
{{/opinionformhtml}}
{{/opinions}}
{{#none}}
<p>{{text}}</p>
{{/none}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
{{#back}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>
{{/back}}
